title: the future of web development
---
date: 2023-12-20
---
excerpt: predictions and thoughts on where web technology is heading in the next few years.
---
body:

The web keeps reinventing itself. From frictionless AI-assisted workflows to edge-native data storage, the shape of the
stack is changing faster than ever. I share a few trends I'm watching closely and how they influence the way I approach
architecture and developer experience today.
